# Place-holder so this directory exists in a fresh clone.
#
# api/Dockerfile does `COPY dashboard/dist/ ./dashboard/dist/`, which fails at
# build time when the directory is absent -- and dist/ is gitignored, so every
# Gate 3 run from a clean checkout failed here. The build output itself stays
# ignored (see .gitignore); this file only makes the directory real.
#
# Gate 3 additionally runs `npm --prefix dashboard run build` before
# `docker compose build`, so the container normally gets a real dashboard too.
